    "detailed_description": "<strong>Rage and rampage as a fast zombie mob!</strong><br><br>First, they killed you. Then, they brought you back. Now you're loose and it's time for some sweet, sweet, blood-soaked payback! Kill 'em, baby! Kill 'em all!<br><br><strong>Just click where you want the zombies to go, and the ones in range will attack nearby enemies automatically.</strong><br><br>03/29/24 Added hotkeys 1-5 for easy weapon selection<br><br>3-5 hour game.<br><br><i>FLASHING LIGHTS WARNING: This game contains flashing lights and trippy audio visualizations. THESE EFFECTS ARE ON BY DEFAULT ON THE START SCREEN and can be toggled on or off from the SETTINGS menu or the PAUSE menu at any time. If you are sensitive to flashing lights you should turn them off immediately.</i><br><br><br>Slammin' soundtrack includes The Gobs, Citric Dummies, GEE TEE, Thee Windom Earles, Redshift, Dope Sweater, Checkpoint, BEEF, Prison Affair, The Zombie Dandies, Voodoo Puppets, Untimely Dosage, Sovran, The Hydeouts, Punk Rock Opera, Sept, No Brains, Safety Pins, Bass Feens, Hawt Denim, Los Pecadores, Vampire Death, and more!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Rage and rampage as a fast zombie mob!</strong><br><br>First, they killed you. Then, they brought you back. Now you're loose and it's time for some sweet, sweet, blood-soaked payback! Kill 'em, baby! Kill 'em all!<br><br><strong>Just click where you want the zombies to go, and the ones in range will attack nearby enemies automatically.</strong><br><br>03/29/24 Added hotkeys 1-5 for easy weapon selection<br><br>3-5 hour game.<br><br><i>FLASHING LIGHTS WARNING: This game contains flashing lights and trippy audio visualizations. THESE EFFECTS ARE ON BY DEFAULT ON THE START SCREEN and can be toggled on or off from the SETTINGS menu or the PAUSE menu at any time. If you are sensitive to flashing lights you should turn them off immediately.</i><br><br><br>Slammin' soundtrack includes The Gobs, Citric Dummies, GEE TEE, Thee Windom Earles, Redshift, Dope Sweater, Checkpoint, BEEF, Prison Affair, The Zombie Dandies, Voodoo Puppets, Untimely Dosage, Sovran, The Hydeouts, Punk Rock Opera, Sept, No Brains, Safety Pins, Bass Feens, Hawt Denim, Los Pecadores, Vampire Death, and more!",
